1
00:00:00,866 --> 00:00:02,196
(Penny:)Are you talking to me?

2
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:05,000
(Raj:)Is there another Penny here?

3
00:00:05,955 --> 00:00:08,665
(Raj:)I had such plans. I had dreams.

4
00:00:08,833 --> 00:00:12,213
(Raj:)I was going to be the Indira Gandhi
of particle astrophysics.

5
00:00:12,378 --> 00:00:14,588
(Raj:)But with a penis, of course.

6
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:17,550
(Leonard:)It's amazing.

7
00:00:17,717 --> 00:00:19,177
(Raj:)Ever since I was a little boy...

8
00:00:19,343 --> 00:00:22,223
(Raj:)...my father wanted me
to be a gynecologist like him.

9
00:00:22,388 --> 00:00:26,348
How can I be a gynecologist?
I can barely look a woman in the eye.

10
00:00:29,854 --> 00:00:33,194
You know what? I'm not going
to let my parents control my future.

11
00:00:33,357 --> 00:00:34,817
(Raj:)It's time for a showdown.

12
00:00:34,984 --> 00:00:37,114
(Raj:)Somebody give me a computer
with a Webcam.

13
00:00:37,278 --> 00:00:41,368
(Penny:)Okay. Sweetie, I think
that's the Grasshopper talking.

14
00:00:41,532 --> 00:00:43,032
(Raj:)It's about to tell my parents...

15
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:46,540
(Raj:)...that I'm not riding an elephant
down the aisle with Lalita Gupta.

16
00:00:46,704 --> 00:00:48,624
(Penny:)Okay, calm down.

17
00:00:48,789 --> 00:00:50,999
No one can make you get married.

18
00:00:51,334 --> 00:00:53,584
Why don't you meet this girl,
see what happens?

19
00:00:53,753 --> 00:00:56,343
Haven't you been listening?
I cannot talk to women.

20
00:00:56,839 --> 00:01:01,019
(Dr Koothrappali:)- Raj...
- No, no, let's see how long it takes him.

